            "verseId": "ISA.47.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.7+REV.18.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ibyah 18.7-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Nuko rero umva ibi yewe uwihaye kwinezeza, ukicara udabagira, ukibwira mu mutima uti ‘Ni jye uriho nta wundi, sinzaba umupfakazi kandi sinzapfusha abana.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko ibyo gupfusha abana no gupfakara byombi bizakugeraho umunsi umwe bigutunguye, uburozi bwawe nubwo ari bwinshi bute, n'ibikagiro byawe nubwo ari byinshi cyane, bizakugeraho byimazeyo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuko wiringiye ubugome bwawe ukavuga uti ‘Nta wundeba.’ Ubwenge bwawe n'ubuhanga bwawe ni byo bikuyobeje uribwira uti ‘Ni jye uriho nta wundi.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ni cyo kizatuma ibyago bikugeraho ntumenye irasukiro ryabyo, ishyano rizakugwira ntuzashobora kuryikuraho, kandi kurimbuka utari wamenya kuzagutungura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko komeza ibikagiro byawe n'uburozi bwawe uko bingana, ibyo wahirimbaniye uhereye mu buto bwawe ahari aho bizagira icyo bikuvura, ahari bizatuma unesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inama zawe nyinshi zirakuruhije, abaraguza ijuru n'abaraguza inyenyeri n'abahanura ukwezi kubonetse bakavuga ibizaba, nibahaguruke bagukize ibizakuzaho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Dore bazamera nk'ibishingwe umuriro ubatwike, ntibazikiza imbaraga z'ibirimi byawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ntuzaba amakara yo kotwa, cyangwa icyotero cyo kwicarwa iruhande. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uko ni ko ibyo wahirimbaniye bizakubera, abaguranaga nawe uhereye mu buto bwawe bazigendera umuntu wese yigira ahe, nta wuzaba uhari wo kugukiza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
